    "detailed_description": "Welcome Art Enjoyers!! <br />\r\nTo the abstract world of Art Dash. A place full of shapes and colors galore! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as a Triangle moving through the color dungeon as it fights other shapes unknown and obtain rare and magical items to enhance yourself. <br />\r\nSuch as: pencils and pens! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game can be overly difficult or unfair at times but overall a fun mess of time!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is FAR from being finished so updates are to come at a slow pace. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was made by One guy just finishing high school, so please just enjoy the ride!",
